[API Documentation]
A long short-term memory (LSTM) cell.

    .. math::

        \begin{array}{ll}
        i = \sigma(W_{ii} x + b_{ii} + W_{hi} h + b_{hi}) \\
        f = \sigma(W_{if} x + b_{if} + W_{hf} h + b_{hf}) \\
        g = \tanh(W_{ig} x + b_{ig} + W_{hg} h + b_{hg}) \\
